{
  "//": "A CHARGE AGAINST THE POWERFUL (docs/LADDER.md, 'A charge against the powerful'). Three scenes for the player's house: the head goes into exile rather than wait for a verdict (went_into_exile), the Senate votes one of the house home (called_home_from_exile), and a charge against one of the house's powerful is thrown back (charge_thrown_back). ChargeSystem raises each for a year; each scene clears the flag it reads. No roles: the one abroad or acquitted is named in the house's news, and the scene is the head's.",
